        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sodium hypochlorite, 15% in H2O, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium hypochlorite, 15% in H2O, at plant
Production of NaOCl from chlorine emissions captured in 50% sodium hydroxide solution.;
CAS number: 007681-52-9; 
Formula: NaOCl; 
UUID: cb94ab60-7f4d-3b40-90df-bc7a9332af65
includes all precursor compounds except for chlorine, which is treated as process air emissions, transports and infrastructure
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: based on literature data and plant data in Europe and North America
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: see technology 
Extrapolations: see GeneralComment
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cb94ab60-7f4d-3b40-90df-bc7a9332af65.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
